7. Conclusion

A Progressive Web Application is a practical option for the college canteen food-ordering system. It is easy to access through a browser, can be added to a home screen on supported devices, and can be maintained centrally. With menu browsing, order placement, secure payments, and order notifications, it can make the canteen process more organized and convenient for both students and staff.

